;refers to jap meme of cute and affectionate flan, the original spelling doesn't convey it as author went with a pun
RESULTS:1 = Flan Ufufu
RESULTS:2 = Untranslated.<br>Affectionate and more mature portrayal of Flan.<br>Low line count.
